  "description": "ARSoft Legacy WinForms Custom Controls Library provides a set of enhanced, ready-to-use controls for Windows Forms applications. \nIt includes advanced Label, TextBox, and specialized input controls (e.g., for CPF, CNPJ, CEP, email, currency, integers, and doubles) \nwith built-in validation, masking, placeholder support, temporary message display, and culture-aware formatting. \nDesigned to simplify UI development, improve user experience, and reduce repetitive boilerplate code.",
